<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru always believed in me...</font>

26
00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than myself or Neji or
any of us here... He is stronger!</font>

27
00:01:46,290 --> 00:01:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, fatso!</font>

28
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't<i> you </i>say that!</font>

29
00:01:51,380 --> 00:01:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu...</font>

30
00:01:55,170 --> 00:01:56,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arm!</font>

31
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu...</font>

32
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leg!</font>

33
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu...</font>

34
00:02:10,690 --> 00:02:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arm!</font>

35
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mess with me! Scum!</font>

36
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

37
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What!</font>

38
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Super Expansion Jutsu!</font>

39
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:54,590
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Goodbye</font>

40
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:54,590
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">My Friend...!</font>

41
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:54,590
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="50">Even So, I Believe</font></font>

42
00:02:58,030 --> 00:03:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it... Shikamaru...</font>

43
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

44
00:03:10,670 --> 00:03:13,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe I had to get to
the second state</font>

45
00:03:13,130 --> 00:03:15,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for an opponent like this one...</font>

46
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:21,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slamming Palm!</font>

47
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... What is that appearance?!</font>

48
00:03:44,950 --> 00:03:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that it's come to this it's over.</font>

49
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the second state I can put out ten times
more power than I have thus far.</font>

50
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm invincible.</font>

51
00:04:02,630 --> 00:04:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too painful to move...</font>

52
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:08,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knew that the side effects
of the Curry Pill would be this intense.</font>

53
00:04:10,890 --> 00:04:14,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what happens...</font>

54
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to a powerless scum for butting in!</font>

55
00:04:22,450 --> 00:04:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Playing Ninja better suits you!</font>

56
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:35,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raise your hand if you're playing Ninja.</font>

57
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait...</font>

58
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock, paper... scissors!</font>

59
00:04:42,300 --> 00:04:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Split!</font>

60
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two, three...</font>

61
00:04:47,550 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait!</font>

62
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">99... 100!</font>

63
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I said split!</font>

64
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

65
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Found you!</font>

66
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up quietly the two of you!</font>

67
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We finally caught 'em!</font>

68
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sick of this!
The team with Choji always loses!</font>

69
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry...</font>

70
00:05:47,530 --> 00:05:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need a lot of Chakra
for this "second state."</font>

71
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take whatever Chakra
you have left!</font>

72
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, I'll take them now.</font>

73
00:06:05,590 --> 00:06:07,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not much left...</font>

74
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're empty!</font>

75
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:13,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't had nearly enough to eat...</font>

76
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said I haven't had enough to eat!</font>

77
00:06:33,530 --> 00:06:34,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

78
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:37,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What just one last piece, huh...</font>

79
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I said I haven't had
enough to eat...</font>

80
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought you're the scum
used as a sacrificial pawn.</font>

81
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die... you pitiful fatso the odd man out.</font>

82
00:06:57,930 --> 00:07:00,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you play Ninja with us!</font>

83
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:02,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

84
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:06,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because if we let you play
we'll lose.</font>

85
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:07,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're slow.</font>

86
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:14,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah but... then the number
of people won't be even.</font>

87
00:07:14,330 --> 00:07:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shogi is fun
because the number of pieces are even.</font>

88
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A piece that is useless is
the same as not having that piece!</font>

89
00:07:24,130 --> 00:07:25,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, that's right!</font>

90
00:07:28,550 --> 00:07:30,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're the ones with fewer people
and we're not complaining.</font>

91
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up, let's do it!</font>

92
00:07:32,510 --> 00:07:34,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's okay with you then it's fine...</font>

93
00:07:35,550 --> 00:07:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, it's settled!</font>

94
00:07:36,810 --> 00:07:38,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can win it!</font>

95
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

96
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are we gonna hide this time?</font>

97
00:08:18,180 --> 00:08:22,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And um, the whole Akimichi Clan
is fat and slow...</font>

98
00:08:22,850 --> 00:08:25,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what everyone says.</font>

99
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really...</font>

100
00:08:30,150 --> 00:08:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Choji you're a kindhearted guy...
more than everyone else.</font>

101
00:08:37,870 --> 00:08:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One day you'll surely make friends
who'll see that quality of yours.</font>

102
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then you should cherish
those friends</font>

103
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and be the kind of friends
who believe in each other...</font>

104
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I really make... friends like that...
someone like me...?</font>

105
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rest in peace...</font>

106
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're not the only one
I'm going to get.</font>

107
00:09:04,350 --> 00:09:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After I kill you,</font>

108
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:12,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get the cruel sleazy
mean guys who used you as a sacrifice!</font>

109
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he... promised...</font>

110
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better catch up with us... Choji.</font>

111
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

112
00:09:32,760 --> 00:09:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's definitely going to defeat
the opponent and come after us...!</font>

113
00:09:40,010 --> 00:09:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep!</font>

114
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right... he can do it.</font>

115
00:09:46,690 --> 00:09:48,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! While I'm here...</font>

116
00:09:50,110 --> 00:09:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too...</font>

117
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right everyone,</font>

118
00:09:57,320 --> 00:10:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we get Sasuke back
before Choji catches up!</font>

119
00:10:01,950 --> 00:10:02,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

120
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Here we come!</font>

121
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:22,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's late... that Jirobo...</font>

122
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:25,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's greedy and eats so much...</font>

123
00:10:25,890 --> 00:10:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably squeezing out Chakra
even from the marrow of their bones.</font>

124
00:10:28,980 --> 00:10:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish he had switched
with me already...</font>

125
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I'll give it back!</font>

126
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

127
00:10:44,830 --> 00:10:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I linger
I won't be able to catch up.</font>

128
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about time to put an end to this.</font>

129
00:10:54,130 --> 00:10:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chili Pepper Pill is left...</font>

130
00:10:57,380 --> 00:11:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... if I take that...
I'll die without a doubt...</font>

131
00:11:08,770 --> 00:11:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you dare die, Choji...</font>

132
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:19,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've been doing things together
since that day...</font>

133
00:11:41,090 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...! You...</font>

134
00:11:44,050 --> 00:11:46,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... were there just now...</font>

135
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about playing Ninja?</font>

136
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a drag
so I pulled myself out from it.</font>

137
00:11:51,690 --> 00:11:52,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

138
00:11:52,690 --> 00:11:55,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way that's my special seat.</font>

139
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your special seat?</font>

140
00:11:57,320 --> 00:12:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like to lie on my back and
look at the clouds on a nice day like this.</font>

141
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come to look at clouds?</font>

142
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind if I sit there?</font>

143
00:12:10,290 --> 00:12:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... sure!</font>

144
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a good place.
You can see the clouds well.</font>

145
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:22,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

146
00:12:27,010 --> 00:12:28,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you...</font>

147
00:12:28,260 --> 00:12:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

148
00:12:30,850 --> 00:12:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">watch the clouds with me
and lounge around?</font>

149
00:12:36,610 --> 00:12:37,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

150
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:42,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know! I-I brought snacks.
Want some?</font>

151
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that'd be great!</font>

152
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks.</font>

153
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eating potato chips
while watching clouds... this is the best.</font>

154
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yep!</font>

155
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Shikamaru...
from the Nara Clan.</font>

156
00:13:05,050 --> 00:13:06,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... What's your name?</font>

157
00:13:07,550 --> 00:13:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Choji! Akimichi Choji
of the Akimichi Clan!</font>

158
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, huh...
I think I'll get along with you.</font>

159
00:13:16,810 --> 00:13:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too!</font>

160
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll always do things together
from now on too.</font>

161
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...!</font>

162
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:50,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru... Sorry... I can't go...</font>

163
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over...</font>

164
00:13:54,350 --> 00:13:56,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this guy...</font>

165
00:13:57,690 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to beat him...
even if it means death.</font>

166
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what you do now
it's too late!</font>

167
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crushing Palm!</font>

168
00:14:31,050 --> 00:14:33,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's that...?</font>

169
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:35,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

170
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boulder Blow!</font>

171
00:14:41,190 --> 00:14:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good!</font>

172
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm 100 times stronger than before!</font>

173
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:56,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They say that food
can be a reason</font>

174
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for people to hold a horrible grudge
against somebody.</font>

175
00:14:58,330 --> 00:15:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The blow just now...
was for eating the last bite of my snack...</font>

176
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:05,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

177
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy has so much Chakra that
his body has changed physically!</font>

178
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:11,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this is...</font>

179
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for making fun of me by calling me
a sacrificial pawn and fat!</font>

180
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what I can't forgive you for
more than anything else...</font>

181
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure do suffer when
you have a stupid leader. You underlings!</font>

182
00:15:28,570 --> 00:15:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'll kill you losers</font>

183
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before you suffer working
under a glum shadow lover like him!</font>

184
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:41,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should blame your stupid leader
for choosing you!</font>

185
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You insulted my best friend!</font>

186
00:15:47,170 --> 00:15:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than mocking me
by calling me fat</font>

187
00:15:53,090 --> 00:15:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and poaching the last bite
of a four-star meal...</font>

188
00:15:57,930 --> 00:15:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't forgive you for that!</font>

189
00:16:01,890 --> 00:16:04,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of my Chakra... to my left hand!</font>

190
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh uh-oh...!</font>

191
00:16:07,230 --> 00:16:11,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This blow... is heavier than my life!</font>

192
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:14,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait...! Don't be hasty...!</font>

193
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I won.</font>

194
00:17:00,450 --> 00:17:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me... I won!</font>

195
00:17:28,110 --> 00:17:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone...</font>

196
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Choji...</font>

197
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:18,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're a kindhearted guy
more than everyone else...</font>

198
00:18:20,950 --> 00:18:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One day you'll surely make friends
who'll see that part of you...</font>

199
00:18:28,290 --> 00:18:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then you should cherish
those friends</font>

200
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and be the kind of friends
who believe in each other.</font>

201
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Hurry up and get over here."
It's Naruto.</font>

202
00:18:56,150 --> 00:18:58,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Everyone's waiting."
Kiba...</font>

203
00:19:00,530 --> 00:19:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

204
00:19:17,130 --> 00:19:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-Shika-Cho!</font>

205
00:19:33,690 --> 00:19:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it is just potato chips</font>

206
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let anybody else have
the last piece no matter who you are.</font>

207
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:43,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji and I have worked as a team
for many years</font>

208
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:46,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so coordinating with him
is easiest for me.</font>

209
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad...</font>

210
00:19:55,960 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've made... a lot of friends...</font>

211
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

212
00:20:44,130 --> 00:20:45,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothin'...</font>

